@startuml structural_scheme
title Структурно-функциональная схема диалоговой системы

skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #455A64
}

actor "Пользователь" as User

package "Клиент (браузер)" as Client #E1F5FE {
    component "index.html\n(UI: 4 view)" as UI
    component "app.js\n(REST-клиент)" as JS
    component "styles.css" as CSS
}

package "Сервер Flask (Python 3.12)" as Server #FFF3E0 {

    package "Слой представления" as Layer1 #FFFFFF {
        component "app.py\nREST API (8 endpoints)" as API
    }

    package "Логический слой" as Layer2 #FFFFFF {
        component "NLU\n(nlp_processor.py)" as NLU {
            component "Лемматизатор" as Lemma
            component "Распознаватель\nсущностей" as NER
            component "Классификатор\nинтентов" as Intent
        }

        component "Dialog Manager\n(app.py: active_dialogues)" as DM {
            component "Контекст\nдиалога" as Context
            component "Анафора\n(last_animal)" as Anaphora
        }

        component "NLG\n(response_generator.py)" as NLG {
            component "Диспетчер\nпо интентам" as Dispatcher
            component "Шаблоны\nответов" as Templates
        }
    }

    package "Слой данных" as Layer3 #FFFFFF {
        component "Database Manager\n(database_manager.py)" as DBM
    }
}

database "SQLite\n(dialog_system.db)" as DB #C8E6C9 {
    component "animals_knowledge" as TbAnimals
    component "dialogues" as TbDialogues
    component "messages" as TbMessages
}

component "spaCy\nru_core_news_sm" as Spacy #FFE0B2

' === Связи ===
User -down-> UI : ввод/вывод
UI -right-> JS
JS -right-> CSS

JS <-down-> API : HTTP/JSON\nlocalhost:5003

API -down-> NLU : analyze_text()
API -down-> DM : update_context()
API -down-> NLG : generate_response()
API -down-> DBM : add_message()\nget_history()

NLU -right-> Spacy : nlp(text)
NLU -down-> DM : intent, entities

DM -right-> NLG : intent, animals,\ncontext

NLG -down-> DBM : get_animal_info()

DBM -down-> DB : SQL

note right of API
  **Endpoints:**
  • POST /api/send_message
  • GET  /api/get_history
  • POST /api/new_dialogue
  • POST /api/end_dialogue
  • GET  /api/dialogues
  • GET  /api/dialogue/<id>
  • GET  /api/animals
  • GET  /api/statistics
end note

note right of NLU
  • 7 типов интентов
  • 100+ словоформ
  • Regex + spaCy
end note

note right of NLG
  • Отдельный handler
    на каждый интент
  • 3+ варианта
    шаблона для разнообразия
  • Markdown в ответах
end note

note bottom of DB
  Хранилище:
  • 10 животных
  • Все диалоги
  • Все сообщения с intent/entities
end note

@enduml
